These are AI-generated compatibility resolutions from the existing
PR #7 port source, exported after Git has performed its deterministic
three-way merge of the unchanged official Molly 8.19.2-4 snapshot
with Signal 8.33.2. The original Molly mailboxes remain unchanged.
